  - m_Id: 2300068806656
    m_Localized: TRAINING DOCUMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300131721216
    m_Localized: REDACTION PROCEDURE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300135915520
    m_Localized: 'Turn on the UV lamp and examine the document.

      Find the hidden
      information, then turn off the lamp

      and redact the discovered data.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300135915521
    m_Localized: 'OFFICIAL MEMORANDUM


      Agent [[Username]] has been assigned

      to
      [[Organisation Training Facility]].


      Click on a word

      (Or hover
      over text while holding LMB)

      to redact it.


      Some information
      cannot be detected

      under normal lighting.


      Use the ultraviolet
      lamp

      to locate the hidden data.


      After locating it, turn off
      the lamp

      and redact the classified information.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300135915525
    m_Localized: 'ASSIGNMENT:


      Redact employee names

      and facility code
      names.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300135915522
    m_Localized: 0
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
